# Chancellor of Tales only answers an Adventure spell its controller casts. Turn 1: Bot1 casts the Chancellor. Turn 2: Bot2 casts
# Blow Off Steam at Bot1 - an Adventure spell, but not Bot1's, so no trigger (stack of one). Turn 3: Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt (an
# instant, not an Adventure: one on the stack), then Blow Off Steam (two: the trigger, declined), then casts Frolicking Familiar from
# exile (the creature half is not an Adventure spell: one on the stack).

